-- Restore 29 gameobject_template rows missing from ArgusCore's world DB but present in
-- AshamaneCore. These are the base templates for gameobject_template_addon rows that ArgusCore
-- already carries, which is why worldserver logged "GameObject template (Entry: X) does not
-- exist but has a record in `gameobject_template_addon`" for each of them - the addon data was
-- never orphaned/stale, the base template itself was simply missing from this DB's dump.
--
-- 22 of these carry a confirmed Legion-era VerifiedBuild (23222/26124/26365). The remaining 7
-- (266295, 266576, 266577, 266592, 266826, 267190, 268621) have VerifiedBuild=0 in AshamaneCore
-- itself (unconfirmed there too), but are restored rather than dropped: they exist as real rows
-- in a primary reference core, so there's no basis to conclude they're not real Legion content -
-- only the 50 entries confirmed absent from every checked source (this DB's own base dump and
-- active migrations, AshamaneCore, and DestinyCore, which carries no gameobject_template data
-- for this build at all) get removed, by 2026_08_06_02_world.sql.
